# إعدادات الإنتاج · production build values
#
# هذه القيم عامة بطبيعتها: Vite يدمجها داخل ملف JavaScript، فيقرؤها أي زائر
# للموقع. الحماية الحقيقية من RLS وليست من إخفاء المفتاح.
#
# These are public by design. Vite inlines them into the client bundle, so any
# visitor can read them from the deployed site; RLS is what actually protects the
# data. Committing them is therefore not an exposure — it only removes the need
# for build-time variables in the Cloudflare dashboard, which an assets-only
# Worker cannot provide.
#
# NEVER put the service_role key here, or in any VITE_ variable. That key
# bypasses RLS entirely and would be readable by every visitor.
#
# Cloudflare build variables of the same name override this file, so you can
# still point a build at a different project without editing the repo.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://mlqmcewcvmyvhgqnutcz.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6Im1scW1jZXdjdm15dmhncW51dGN6Iiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODUwMTQxMDQsImV4cCI6MjEwMDU5MDEwNH0.LAlud1ylP3jymJONf_prksmoceSPhI13aaRTLyM9fT8
